Stage: DO

Purpose:
  DevOps stage. Owns build, deployment and infrastructure validation of
  the unit of work — build pipeline, environment/config changes,
  release — everything VR needs already deployed before it can verify
  the system as a whole.


Requires:
  QA passed (see stages/QA.sdd -> Blocks)


Produces:
  Deployed/released unit of work, in the target environment(s), ready
  for final verification.


Blocks:
  VR — VR MUST NOT verify a unit of work that has not been deployed
  where verification happens (see chains.sdd -> Rules [C5]).


Optional:
  MAY be skipped only when the unit of work requires no deployment/infra
  change at all (never silently — see chains.sdd -> Rules [C7]).


Skills:
  @../../skills/devops/

  (see chains.sdd -> DoesNotOwn — this file defines WHEN/responsibility
  only; HOW the deployment is actually implemented belongs to
  skills/devops/, not here.)


State: + (vocabulary defined here; skills/devops/ content is not yet
  written — see skills/skills.sdd -> SkillDomains, state: boş)


Note:
  (prompt/new/33.md, STEP 11) Extracted out of the flat feature.chain /
  bugfix.chain / change.chain, where the DO responsibility was repeated
  inline in each file. Defined once here per NoDuplication; referenced
  from chains.sdd -> Stages and from every template under ./templates/
  that includes a DO step.
